  dialogos:
  - Hey... It's me.
  - Did you notice that our designs have more production value than many other things?
  - I swear it was totally on purpose haha
  - Oh yeah, I was the one in charge of making your eyes..
  - Well, not really, but only because of me you can see this.
  - Art lead here! Yabely Gutierrez, at your service! Although... you can call me
    Skylen <.<!
